/**
 * ORPHEUS — voice line registry (WRITER).
 *
 * Every spoken line in the game, keyed by ID (see DESIGN §10 — all 292 ids, exactly as spelled).
 *   who   : LYRA | CAPCOM | FD | SCI | MIRA | ELENA | TOMAS | SURVEY_A | SURVEY_B | SURVEY_C | PA | CMDR
 *   text  : the performance script for ElevenLabs v4 — natural speech, [audio tags] used sparingly as delivery
 *           direction (never more than two per line). The caption is `text` with [tags] stripped. Numbers that
 *           vary at runtime are never spoken (the HUD / caption meta shows them); only fixed facts are.
 *   q     : (talk / conversation topics) the question text the player picks. Not voiced.
 *   title : (logs / messages) short UI title. Not voiced. In the quarters terminal the sender is shown beside it,
 *           so message titles do not repeat the sender's name.
 *
 * Notes for integration
 *   - mission.reply.go.horizon is spoken by FD (Director Bell), as the registry allows.
 *   - halcyon.<who>.hello has no `q` (the NPC's opener); every other halcyon.<who>.* conversation line has one.
 *   - Names that TTS might spell out letter-by-letter (Thea, Lantern) are written in ordinary case in `text`.
 *
 * TALLY (total of every `text`, audio tags included — the budget cap is 85,000):
 *   292 lines · 59,519 characters (59,076 as captions, tags stripped); CMDR lines are generated twice (+828).
 *   LYRA 196 lines / 34,773 · CAPCOM 40 / 6,295 · MIRA 11 / 4,057 · ELENA 6 / 3,397 · FD 8 / 2,462 · TOMAS 4 / 2,233
 *   SCI 6 / 1,802 · SURVEY_B 3 / 1,397 · SURVEY_A 2 / 988 · CMDR 9 / 828 · PA 6 / 722 · SURVEY_C 1 / 565
 */
